---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Blog | Ticketto"
seoTitle: "Blog di Ticketto: Guide su Eventi e Biglietteria"
description: "Guide operative, strategie e casi di studio per organizzatori di eventi. Biglietteria, check-in, marketing e SIAE."
permalink: "/blog/index.html"
altIt: "https://ticketto.it/blog/"
altEn: "https://ticketto.it/en/blog/"
---
<section class="hub">
  <h1>Blog</h1>
  <p>Guide pratiche, numeri veri e strumenti per organizzare eventi senza imprevisti al check-in.</p>
  <div class="posts-grid">
    {% for post in collections.posts %}
      {% include "partials/article-card.njk" %}
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "Blog",
  "@id": "https://ticketto.it/blog/#blog",
  "name": "Blog di Ticketto",
  "description": "Guide operative per organizzare eventi in Italia.",
  "publisher": { "@id": "https://ticketto.it/#organization" },
  "inLanguage": "it-IT",
  "blogPost": [
    {% for post in collections.posts | reverse -%}
    {
      "@type": "BlogPosting",
      "headline": {{ post.data.title | dump | safe }},
      "url": "https://ticketto.it{{ post.url }}",
      "datePublished": "{{ post.date | isoDate }}"
    }{% if not loop.last %},{% endif %}
    {%- endfor %}
  ]
}
</script>
